{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/250fbeddde6723a89680d32645d0a7da2418a85a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=3x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> for all real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, then the statement:\n\"<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/4/794984eafd0f980fd9d30c4e4aa951c4967eccd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)+4|&lt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8ca97f53de30cd0c08811df9c6583c3f87cd231e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x+2|&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91a5b8b0bb9d8e27be1b824f08fd6df60ba1d9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />\"\nis true when\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/3/1d3a462ac8f9ab4be2c250a9097fb13df694b2ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ b\\le a/3\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ b &gt; a/3\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ a\\le b/3\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ a &gt; b/3\\\\ \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{The statement is never true.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"470\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/250fbeddde6723a89680d32645d0a7da2418a85a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=3x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/4/794984eafd0f980fd9d30c4e4aa951c4967eccd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)+4|&lt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/0/2a01052b205eaa5617f32f7110c250993eaaf3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3x+6|=|3(x+2)|=3|x+2|&lt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"279\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79336ee74ef68ae40f043325d3192d16064ad97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x+2|&lt;\\frac{a}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"88\" height=\"33\" />. Therefore, we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78570f0b54e6e38bb5a3348967c61e7589949e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x+2|&lt;b\\implies |x+2|&lt;\\frac{a}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"221\" height=\"33\" />. This is clearly only true when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6feb154b382843874785c6860dcf7631260e543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\le\\frac{a}{3}, \\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Prob